  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability of services for key populations in South East Asia region - Asia - Multicountry HIV SEA AFAO (01-Jul-2022-31-Dec-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry HIV SEA AFAO, HIV, Health Equity Matters Limited (HEM)This program has the following goals: Improved sustainability of evidence-informed prioritized HIV services for key populations and people living with HIV in Bhutan, Mongolia, the Philippines and Sri Lanka. The objectives of this program are: Accelerating financial sustainability.  Improving strategic information availability and use.  Promoting programmatic sustainability.  Removing human rights and gender-related barriers to services</narrative>
  </description>
